{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This book contains several of tamazusa's small-scale STG works, mainly game jam works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Haze&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rhythm-action biscuit-multiplying shooter created in 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created for Brackeys Game Jam 2025.2.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Record 104&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cyclical bullet hell shooter where you destroy enemies, acquire bomb stocks, and consume them to get through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Senli 316&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created in 2021.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bullet hell shooter where you release a shield to eliminate enemy bullets and advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;elemano&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created in 2020.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bullet hell shooter where you switch the field's attributes to control attacking/attacking enemies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4152930?t=1762410540","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4152930?t=1762410540","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152930/1a956414c3e3e93484d953185961ab61bb356c68/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762410540","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152930/1a956414c3e3e93484d953185961ab61bb356c68/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762410540","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This book contains several of tamazusa's small-scale STG works, mainly game jam works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"